# WarriorCastHoldMagic (21628, its shipped hold), every draw 0, 400 away from the character. A hit
# from farther than 300, on a draw under 50, wants its hold magic (4047) on the character, weight
# 1000000, beside the Warrior's hate, which the hit's desire selection casts. Once it held, a
# second hit adds no hold desire: the first stays at 1000000.
